<h1 id="submission-guidelines">Submission Guidelines</h1>

<h2 id="formatting-requirements">Formatting Requirements</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Use ACM SIGCONF template (available on conference website)</li>
  <li>Anonymous submission for double-blind review</li>
  <li>Supplementary materials (max 50MB) allowed</li>
  <li>Mandatory artifact availability statement</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="review-process">Review Process</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Three-phase review with author rebuttal</li>
  <li>Artifact evaluation for reproducibility</li>
  <li>Conflict-of-interest aware assignment</li>
  <li>Cross-disciplinary reviewer matching</li>
</ul>

